  "signatureHoleDescription": "Hole 17 is the longest at Bryant Lake at 479 feet — a par 3 that plays even bigger with the hills and the lake views working against you. It's the hole that separates good rounds from great ones here, and the one everyone talks about on the walk back to the lot.",
